<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/SsvcDecisionType/attend> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The vulnerability requires attention from the organization's internal, supervisory-level individuals. Necessary actions include requesting assistance or information about the vulnerability, and may involve publishing a notification either internally and/or externally. CISA recommends remediating Attend vulnerabilities sooner than standard update timelines."@en .
